scope one keystone recovered and landed -- the vessel room's coverage instrument, its roster row, the door page it corrects, and one ledger row folded at its second number
status GREEN -- amphora_roster witness green on metal (40 behaviors, 0 failed), scan verdict=ok with uncovered=0 and orphan_rows=0. Two cold-open reds close with this landing (stash_record, and standing_equipment's roll-up of it); three stand and are named on the card as another lane's: reds_ledger_monotone, reds_row_present, reds_spine_derive.
recommend keep-going -- carry the same coverage scan to bron-resins/, this lane's other room, one witness and one roster row
